{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「購物狂」杜如風 (Helen) 在TVB節目《跟風旅行團》中，私心推介一間星級改裝服飾店，連BIGBANG成員GD及BLACKPINK成員Jennie都是捧場客。Helen一踏入店內即被海量款式淹沒，更對一頂索價逾3,000港元的帽子心動不已。面對心頭好，她竟忍不住驚呼，到底這間神店有何魔力，令她差點失守？\n</p>\n<h2>杜如風見3千蚊帽心動 驚呼：呢度會死人㗎</h2>\n<p>曾一口氣豪花35萬買靚衫的杜如風，在節目中帶路到訪她「私心推介」的星級改裝服飾店。一踏入服飾店，她立即被海量的獨特款式「淹沒」，見到心頭好更會馬上即試。其中一頂叫價超過3,000港元的帽子，令Helen相當心動，但同時亦被價錢嚇到，忍不住對著鏡頭驚嘆：「呢度會死人㗎！」到底這位購物狂最後會「大買特買」還是忍手全身而退，就要留意節目分曉。</p>\n<h2>解構GD Jennie熱捧神店 每件衫獨一無二</h2>\n<p>這間服飾店之所以成為潮人聖地，全因被有「最會穿衣服的男星」之稱的韓國演員柳承範發現後火速爆紅。店舖主打將名牌重新設計改造，每一件都是獨一無二的單品，因而吸引大批明星捧場。星級顧客名單星光熠熠，包括BIGBANG成員GD（權志龍）、BLACKPINK成員Jennie、IVE成員Liz、表志勳（P.O）等。據知店內更有發售GD戴過的帽子及Jennie用過的髮箍等同款商品，絕對是粉絲必到之處。</p>\n<h2>網民跪求店舖地址 「跟住Helen買實無死」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，這間星味十足的潮店立即引起網民極大興趣，不少人都表示希望親身到訪。網民紛紛留言表示：「GD同Jennie都去，間舖一定好猛料！」、「跪求地址！下次去韓國一定要去朝聖！」、「3,000蚊頂帽，真係會死人，但好想知Helen最後有冇買到！」、「跟住杜如風買嘢實無死，佢啲taste好正。」、「改裝名牌呢個concept好吸引，好想去睇下！」</p>\n<p>店鋪名稱：Musée de Bell &amp; Nouveau<br/>\n地址：首爾市江南區新沙洞541-17<br/>\n營業時間：每日 12:00 – 22:00</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_9500086876afd2c773ef6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_9500086876afd2c773ef6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_11319716106afd2c7d31f83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_11319716106afd2c7d31f83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17a_1236591236afd2c8451dc4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17a_1236591236afd2c8451dc4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_19929770766afd2c8b5a501.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_19929770766afd2c8b5a501.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_7981635296afd2c91f2075.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_7981635296afd2c91f2075.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14186991936afd2c9b2907f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14186991936afd2c9b2907f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20a_10824730996afd2ca342e99.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20a_10824730996afd2ca342e99.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_9370671436afd2cab599b4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_9370671436afd2cab599b4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:04:14.502054+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1137,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:30:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:23.613345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:24.125036+00:00","content_hash":"9aa62fa6718368c895be75c80286872e0415e8ac0ac929379a22c3269d011e69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}